{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1358053-white-elephant-for-mockery-the-spirit-court-of-drowned-promises","id":1358053,"title":"[White Elephant for Mockery] - The Spirit Court of Drowned Promises","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-31T12:41:06-08:00","id":1358053,"title":"[White Elephant for Mockery] - The Spirit Court of Drowned Promises","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1350958-the-ninth-annual-exalted-white-elephant?p=1352273#post1352273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm in. I'd like a demon or a god or a collection thereof.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hereby presenting, unfashionably late as it is, The Spirit Court of Drowned Promises (Or Rather, Three Sample Gods From It): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11p2W5eAq_3d83dOgHcpbuM7qmRWXyL1NLNS1PDgnKGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> (Yes, I've no clue how to format posts in this forum)<br /> <br /> I got the idea from the Wu-Jian section of The Realm, a court of spirits cast underwater by the Immaculate Order when they failed to impress them. I merged that hook with the later one that mentioned a destroyed Crescent Temple lying at the bottom of Wu-Jian's waters, making Crescent Temple the home of the Spirit Court.<br /> <br /> I also wrote the three sample Gods here as beings whose purview would not be to the IO's liking, and unfortunately the ideas that came to mind could be triggering or offensive to some. I've put Trigger Warnings in the document but, to give a quick summary, one of them is the Mistress of Drowned Sorrows - that is, the Goddess of suicide via drowning in Wu-Jian; and another one of them is the Avatar of Tidal Lunacy, dealing almost exclusively in Derangement-related powers. The one in the middle is an Overseer of Treasures Lost at Sea, who insisted himself to be brought down with the rest of his Court despite his purview being mostly inoffensive: he's vying for a position in Heaven, and using the Court as one massive treasure lost at sea as a way to bolster his purview and improve his chances of getting there. The others don't like him, nor each other, much. <br /> <br /> Unfortunately, all three are slightly rushed as life and holidays kept getting in the way and inspiration waned, but given feedback I am willing to edit them and change things around. They all have a LOT of Charms each compared to official entries, so Storytellers concerned with tracking things, feel free to trim them down to the ones you need. And, yes, they all know Kung Fu, this is Wu-Jian after all. Everybody knows kung fu in Wu-Jian. Obviously. Even the siaka-sized octotrout.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T16:09:57-08:00","id":1358097,"title":"","content":"This is frankly amazing. Well done!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T21:36:10-08:00","id":1358140,"title":"","content":"Glad you like it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}